WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.042 --> 00:00:04.000
- He's the fastest player maybe we've
ever seen in the history of the sport.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.625
- This is so weird.
- It's weird.

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:07.542
It's uncomfortable.
- I look through the blinds.

