00:00:21.042 --> 00:00:23.583
Why? Because...
- [In unison] Aaron Rodgers is

00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:26.167
the greatest quarterback
we've ever seen.

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:29.292
Kyle Shanahan is our
favorite coach in the NFL.

00:00:29.292 --> 00:00:32.958
- And they faced off, 33-30.
- Awesome game.

00:00:32.958 --> 00:00:34.333
- And if it ends with

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:37.583
an Aaron Rodgers last drive
to win it

00:00:37.583 --> 00:00:39.333
it's a beautiful game.
- It is a beautiful game.

00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:42.583
And Aaron Rodgers is amazing,
and doing this on one leg.

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:45.333
And I just would like to remind
everybody out there, you know

00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:47.583
their offensive schematics
on Green Bay—

00:00:47.583 --> 00:00:49.292
- Very basic.
- OK, very basic.

00:00:49.292 --> 00:00:51.083
The talent
on their football team

00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:53.542
they're a 6-10 football team
without Aaron Rodgers.

00:00:53.542 --> 00:00:56.083
- You said this morning—
- Right.
- That the Niners are more talented

00:00:56.083 --> 00:00:57.958
position by position
than the Packers.

00:00:57.958 --> 00:01:00.292
And we went through,
and I kind of agree with you.

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:02.375
- Well, it's very close,
nonetheless. If it's

00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:04.500
not, you know, if they're not better,
it's at least equal.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.000
But I think
the "G" on the helmet

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.750
and No. 12 at quarterback—
- Yes.

00:01:07.750 --> 00:01:09.500
- Always fools us
into thinking

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.208
"Hey, they're
a Super Bowl contender."

00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:13.125
And you can see
that he's gotta do it all.

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:15.083
Second-leading rusher
on his team with one leg.

00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:17.375
I mean, that's insane.
- Kyle Shanahan's outfit, though.

00:01:17.375 --> 00:01:19.000
- Oh, it's awesome.
- Fantastic.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.875
- It is.
- I've never seen a head coach

00:01:20.875 --> 00:01:22.583
