00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:29.000
I mean, the swagu
coming off of Shanahan

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Lil Shanahan and Tha Kyle V
was bumpin'.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.500
But is this how
he's always dressed?

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:34.958
- It is always how he's dressed.

00:01:34.958 --> 00:01:37.083
He grew up in San Francisco
and Denver.

00:01:37.083 --> 00:01:39.375
He's got a little bit
of that skater vibe.

00:01:39.375 --> 00:01:40.750
- Yes.

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:42.375
- He goes snowboarding,
doin' all that.

00:01:42.375 --> 00:01:45.417
So, yes, that's a very natural
outfit for him.

00:01:45.417 --> 00:01:48.125
He's lookin' cool.
- Let's not forget that Simms

00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:51.125
