tattooed on your leg.

00:01:51.125 --> 00:01:52.792
- Oh, thanks for bringin'
that up. I appreciate that.

00:01:52.792 --> 00:01:53.792
- I don't think a lot of people
have heard that before.

00:01:53.792 --> 00:01:55.292
- Good. That's good. Yeah.

00:01:55.292 --> 00:01:57.292
I don't think they've
heard it either. Thanks.

00:01:57.292 --> 00:01:59.250
