00:02:47.417 --> 00:02:48.833
- Don't say anything.
- You got this.

00:02:48.833 --> 00:02:50.583
- On the count of three.
- Go ahead.

00:02:50.583 --> 00:02:51.708
- Two, three.

00:02:51.708 --> 00:02:53.708
- Ohh!
- [Groaning]

00:02:53.708 --> 00:02:55.208
