It sounds like a TV show.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.458
Damn. What'd you do last year?

00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:19.208
- Oh.
- Hit Smokin' Jay.

00:03:19.208 --> 00:03:22.333
- Damn.
