00:03:22.333 --> 00:03:24.958
- Ahh!
- Wow.

00:03:24.958 --> 00:03:26.375
- Damn, what?!

00:03:26.375 --> 00:03:28.083
- Damn, you had a bad year.
- Damn!

00:03:28.083 --> 00:03:30.333
