00:03:31.625 --> 00:03:33.000
- Actually—oh my God,
yeah

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.000
Both of them
were actually on Jay.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.250
- Really?
- Both of them were on Jay.

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:39.000
