00:04:15.792 --> 00:04:18.000
- That's the same.
Point, good guys.
- Wow.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:20.667
So Nashville was havin'
a down year, huh?

00:04:20.667 --> 00:04:22.542
- Right?
- Down year?

00:04:22.542 --> 00:04:24.167
Oh, it was a very up year.

00:04:24.167 --> 00:04:27.292
