00:06:06.042 --> 00:06:10.167
- I'm nervous.
- I don't know where this is goin'.

00:06:10.167 --> 00:06:12.000
All right. Here's the first one.
- Uh-oh.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.667
- Uh-oh is right.
- Uh-oh.

00:06:13.667 --> 00:06:15.292
Uh-oh!
- Ohh! Ohh!

00:06:15.292 --> 00:06:17.292
