- It's all right.

00:06:45.583 --> 00:06:46.958
- Best of luck. Good luck.

00:06:46.958 --> 00:06:50.542
Way to find your touch.
- Thanks, man.

00:06:50.542 --> 00:06:52.833
- You should probably do it.
You should probably do it.

00:06:52.833 --> 00:06:55.083
- Oh, me?
