00:06:59.667 --> 00:07:01.208
- Oh!
- Ooh!

00:07:01.208 --> 00:07:04.542
- Uno.

00:07:04.542 --> 00:07:06.958
- Ohh!
- There you go. You got it now.

00:07:06.958 --> 00:07:09.292
- We got it.
- Yes.

00:07:09.292 --> 00:07:10.583
- Oh my God.

00:07:10.583 --> 00:07:12.083
- That was it, wasn't it?
- Money.

00:07:12.083 --> 00:07:13.708
