00:08:12.042 --> 00:08:13.542
- Yeah, they should've
gone first.

00:08:13.542 --> 00:08:15.292
- They should've gone first.
We run this show.

00:08:15.292 --> 00:08:16.792
I'll get your birthday right
one of these days, dude.

00:08:16.792 --> 00:08:18.167
- Say it for them.
- May 8.

00:08:18.167 --> 00:08:19.917
- We're workin' on it.
We're practicing.

00:08:19.917 --> 00:08:21.625
- 1984? Five?
- No.

00:08:21.625 --> 00:08:22.792
- Six?
- Yes.

00:08:22.792 --> 00:08:24.292
- Oh, '86.
That was a special year.
- Why?

