No. 5.

00:08:45.542 --> 00:08:48.542
- Oh, thanks for liking me.
Uh, No. 5? Tyreek Hill.

00:08:48.542 --> 00:08:50.542
First of all, Tyreek Hill,
we have to start putting him

00:08:50.542 --> 00:08:53.083
in the conversation
with the Antonio Browns

00:08:53.083 --> 00:08:54.833
and Odell Beckham Jrs.
and Julio Joneses

00:08:54.833 --> 00:08:56.583
as one of the best receivers
in the sport.

00:08:56.583 --> 00:08:58.792
He's the most explosive receiver
in the sport.

00:08:58.792 --> 00:09:00.708
He's the guy that can take
a five-yard catch

00:09:00.708 --> 00:09:02.833
