00:09:22.208 --> 00:09:24.500
- I'm gonna go No. 4.
I'm gonna go Melvin Gordon.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.083
- Yeah.
- Talk about breaking tackles.

00:09:26.083 --> 00:09:27.833
Every time I turn on
